 MASSACHUSETTS--(NEWSFILE CORP. - FEBRUARY 18, 2022) - THE THORNTON LAW FIRM REMINDS INVESTORS THAT A CLASS ACTION LAWSUIT HAS BEEN FILED ON BEHALF OF INVESTORS OF FIRST SOLAR, INC. (NASDAQ: FSLR). THE CASE IS CURRENTLY IN THE LEAD PLAINTIFF STAGE. INVESTORS WHO PURCHASED FIRST SOLAR COMMON STOCK BETWEEN FEBRUARY 22, 2019 AND FEBRUARY 20, 2020 MAY CONTACT THE THORNTON LAW FIRM'S INVESTOR PROTECTION TEAM BY VISITING WWW.TENLAW.COM/CASES/FIRST-SOLAR-INC FOR MORE INFORMATION. INVESTORS MAY ALSO EMAIL..."}{'symbol': 'FSLR', 'date': '2022-02-18 09:30:00', 'title': 'FSLR SHAREHOLDER ALERT: JAKUBOWITZ LAW REMINDS FIRST SOLAR SHAREHOLDERS OF A LEAD PLAINTIFF DEADLINE OF MARCH 8, 2022', 'text': 'NEW YORK, FEB. 18, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0JAKUBOWITZ LAW ANNOUNCES THAT A SECURITIES FRAUD CLASS ACTION LAWSUIT HAS COMMENCED ON BEHALF OF SHAREHOLDERS OF FIRST SOLAR, INC. (NASDAQ: FSLR). TO RECEIVE UPDATES ON THE LAWSUIT, FILL OUT THE FORM: HTTPS://CLAIMYOURLOSS.COM/SECURITIES/FIRST-SOLAR-INC-LOSS-SUBMISSION-FORM/?ID=23808&FROM=4 THIS LAWSUIT IS ON BEHALF OF ALL PERSONS OR ENTITIES THAT PURCHASED OR OTHERWISE ACQUIRED SHARES OF FIRST SOLAR COMMON STOCK BETWEEN FEBRUARY 22, 2019, AND FEBRUARY 20, 2020, INCLUSIVE.'}{'symbol': 'INTC', 'date': '2022-02-18 14:00:00', 'title': 'INTEL NAMES CHRISTOPH SCHELL EXECUTIVE VICE PRESIDENT AND CHIEF COMMERCIAL OFFICER', 'text': "SANTA CLARA, CALIF--(BUSINESS WIRE)--CHRISTOPH SCHELL JOINS INTEL TO HELP DRIVE CUSTOMER AND PARTNER SUCCESS AND CAPITALIZE ON THE LARGEST OPPORTUNITY IN THE COMPANY'S HISTORY."}{'symbol': 'IVZ', 'date': '2022-02-18 16:15:00', 'title': 'INVESCO LTD. ANNOUNCES 2022 ANNUAL GENERAL MEETING OF SHAREHOLDERS', 'text': 'ATLANTA, FEB. 18, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0INVESCO LTD. (NYSE:IVZ) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT IT WILL HOLD ITS 2022 ANNUAL GENERAL MEETING OF SHAREHOLDERS ON THURSDAY, MAY 12, 2022 AT 1:00 P.M.'}{'symbol': 'IVZ', 'date': '2022-02-18 10:10:00', 'title': 'INVESCO REAL ESTATE INCOME TRUST INC. ACQUIRES INDUSTRIAL AND GROCERY-ANCHORED RETAIL PROPERTIES', 'text': 'DALLAS, FEB. 18, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- INVESCO REAL ESTATE INCOME TRUST INC. ("INREIT"), AN INSTITUTIONALLY MANAGED PUBLIC NON-LISTED REIT, ANNOUNCED TODAY THE ACQUISITION OF AN INDUSTRIAL PROPERTY AND A GROCERY-ANCHORED RETAIL PROPERTY. THE COMBINED PURCHASE PRICE WAS $94 MILLION, BRINGING THE GROSS ASSETS OF THE INREIT PORTFOLIO TO MORE THAN $850 MILLION.'}{'symbol': 'K', 'date': '2022-02-18 16:05:00', 'title': 'KELLOGG ANNOUNCES SUPPLY CHAIN LEADERSHIP CHANGES', 'text': 'BATTLE CREEK, MICH., FEB. 18, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0KELLOGG COMPANY ANNOUNCED TODAY CHANGES TO ITS SUPPLY CHAIN LEADERSHIP.'}{'symbol': 'K', 'date': '2022-02-18 15:57:00', 'title': 'KELLOGG COMPANY DECLARES REGULAR DIVIDEND OF $0.58 PER SHARE', 'text': 'BATTLE CREEK, MICH., FEB. 18, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- KELLOGG COMPANY (NYSE: K) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS DECLARED A DIVIDEND OF $0.58 PER SHARE ON THE COMMON STOCK OF THE COMPANY, PAYABLE ON MARCH 15, 2022, TO SHAREOWNERS OF RECORD AT THE CLOSE OF BUSINESS ON MARCH 1, 2022.'}{'symbol': 'KEY', 'date': '2022-02-18 10:30:00', 'title': "KEY FAMILY WEALTH AWARDED 'BEST MULTI-FAMILY OFFICE $10B - $20B' AND 'BEST FIDUCIARY/TRUSTEE SERVICE' AT THE 2022 PRIVATE ASSET MANAGEMENT AWARDS", 'text': 'CLEVELAND, FEB. 18, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0KEY FAMILY WEALTH, THE MULTI-FAMILY OFFICE DIVISION OF KEY PRIVATE BANK, WAS RECOGNIZED WITH TWO AWARDS AT THE 2022 PRIVATE ASSET MANAGEMENT (PAM) AWARDS.\xa0 KEY FAMILY WEALTH WAS SELECTED AS THE "BEST MULTI-FAMILY OFFICE" IN THE $10 BILLION - $20 BILLION CATEGORY FROM A SHORTLIST OF FOUR OUTSTANDING MULTI-FAMILY OFFICE PROVIDERS.'}{'symbol': 'KHC', 'date': '2022-02-18 16:05:00', 'title': 'KRAFT HEINZ TO ELEVATE CEO MIGUEL PATRICIO TO BECOME CHAIR OF THE BOARD ALONG WITH ADDITIONAL BOARD REFRESHMENT', 'text': 'PITTSBURGH & CHICAGO--(BUSINESS WIRE)--THE KRAFT HEINZ COMPANY (NASDAQ: KHC) (“KRAFT HEINZ” OR THE “COMPANY”) ANNOUNCED TODAY, THAT THE BOARD OF DIRECTORS 