. 18, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- THE BOARD OF DIRECTORS OF NEXTERA ENERGY, INC. (NYSE: NEE) DECLARED A REGULAR QUARTERLY COMMON STOCK DIVIDEND OF $0.425, AN APPROXIMATE 10% INCREASE VERSUS THE PRIOR-YEAR COMPARABLE QUARTERLY DIVIDEND.'}{'symbol': 'PPG', 'date': '2022-02-18 10:29:00', 'title': "PPG NAMED TO CORPORATE KNIGHTS' CLEAN200 LIST AS TOP PRODUCER OF SUSTAINABLE PAINTS AND COATINGS", 'text': "PITTSBURGH--(BUSINESS WIRE)--PPG (NYSE:PPG) TODAY ANNOUNCED IT WAS RECOGNIZED ON THE CLEAN200™ GLOBAL LIST AS THE TOP PAINTS, COATINGS AND SPECIALTY MATERIALS MANUFACTURER WITH THE GREATEST PERCENT OF 2020 REVENUE FROM SUSTAINABLY ADVANTAGED PRODUCTS. PPG RANKED 74TH OVERALL ON THE LIST IN GREEN REVENUE, REPORTING 35% OF SALES FROM SUSTAINABLY ADVANTAGED PRODUCTS IN 2020. THE COMPANY'S GOAL IS TO ACHIEVE 40% OF SALES FROM SUSTAINABLY ADVANTAGED PRODUCTS BY 2025. “ACCORDING TO CORPORATE KNIGHTS,"}{'symbol': 'PPL', 'date': '2022-02-18 06:45:00', 'title': 'PPL CORPORATION REPORTS 2021 EARNINGS', 'text': 'ALLENTOWN, PA., FEB. 18, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- PPL CORPORATION (NYSE: PPL) ON FRIDAY (2/18) REPORTED A 2021 NET LOSS OF $1.48 BILLION, OR $1.93 PER SHARE, COMPARED WITH REPORTED EARNINGS OF $1.47 BILLION, OR $1.91 PER SHARE IN 2020.'}{'symbol': 'SRE', 'date': '2022-02-18 06:50:00', 'title': "DAN BROUILLETTE, PRESIDENT OF SEMPRA INFRASTRUCTURE APPOINTED TO THE U.S. CHAMBER OF COMMERCE'S U.S.-JAPAN BUSINESS COUNCIL", 'text': 'SAN DIEGO, FEB. 18, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- SEMPRA INFRASTRUCTURE, A SUBSIDIARY OF SEMPRA\xa0(NYSE: SRE) (BMV:SRE), ANNOUNCED TODAY ITS PRESIDENT AND FORMER U.S. SECRETARY OF ENERGY, DAN BROUILLETTE, HAS BEEN ELECTED TO THE U.S. CHAMBER OF COMMERCE\'S U.S.-JAPAN BUSINESS COUNCIL (USJBC) BOARD OF DIRECTORS.\xa0 "I LOOK FORWARD TO WORKING CLOSELY WITH OTHER WORLD-CLASS COMPANIES, AS WELL AS THE U.S. AND JAPANESE GOVERNMENTS, AS WE WORK TO ADVANCE THE TWO COUNTRIES\' COMMERCIAL RELATIONSHIPS TO HELP PROMOTE THE USE OF SECURE, CLEAN ENERGY SOURCES AND SHAPE TRANSPARENT TRADE RULES, STANDARDS AND REGULATIONS," SAID BROUILLETTE.'}{'symbol': 'LUV', 'date': '2022-02-18 14:00:00', 'title': "SOUTHWEST AIRLINES ONCE AGAIN RANKED AMONG FORBES' BEST EMPLOYERS IN AMERICA", 'text': 'DALLAS, FEB. 18, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- SOUTHWEST AIRLINES CO. \xa0(NYSE: LUV) ("THE COMPANY") IS PROUD TO BE NAMED ONE OF FORBES\' 2022 AMERICA\'S BEST EMPLOYERS. THE DALLAS-BASED CARRIER RANKS AMONG THE TOP 100 COMPANIES IN THE LARGE EMPLOYER CATEGORY.'}{'symbol': 'SWK', 'date': '2022-02-18 12:00:00', 'title': 'STANLEY BLACK & DECKER ELECTS ANDREA J. AYERS CHAIR AND ADRIAN V.', 'text': 'NEW BRITAIN, CONN., FEB. 18, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- STANLEY BLACK & DECKER (NYSE: SWK) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS HAS ELECTED ANDREA J.'}{'symbol': 'TSCO', 'date': '2022-02-18 08:58:00', 'title': 'TRACTOR SUPPLY KICKS OFF ANNUAL GRANTS FOR GROWING FUNDRAISER IN SUPPORT OF FFA', 'text': 'BRENTWOOD, TENN.--(BUSINESS WIRE)-- #FFA--TRACTOR SUPPLY COMPANY, THE LARGEST RURAL LIFESTYLE RETAILER IN THE UNITED STATES, IS KICKING OFF ITS SEVENTH ANNUAL GRANTS FOR GROWING FUNDRAISER. THIS EVENT, WHICH IS SCHEDULED DURING NATIONAL FFA WEEK, FEB. 17-28, SUPPORTS NATIONAL FFA ORGANIZATION (FFA) CHAPTERS NATIONWIDE. THE FUNDRAISER SUPPORTS HUNDREDS OF UNIQUE AND SUSTAINABLE AGRICULTURAL PROJECTS IMPLEMENTED BY FFA STUDENTS ACROSS THE COUNTRY. GRANTS FOR GROWING IS A COMPETITIVE GRANT PROGRAM FOR MI'}{'symbol': 'VRSK', 'date': '2022-02-18 08:15:00', 'title': 'VERISK ANNOUNCES LEADERSHIP SUCCESSION', 'text': 'SCOTT G. STEPHENSON TO R ETIRE FROM VERISK FOLLOWING 2022 ANNUAL MEETING'}